id: pm-ycyymg
title: Preserve Git-backed merge-receipt evidence in isolated linked-test contexts
description: "Direct source tracker-context-quality passes, while the same static pipeline under an isolated tracker context blocks health-integrity-zero. Full health identifies merge_receipt_history_reference_missing for pm-1tns7o history line31 and receipt9c9246d9-2411-4a7c-8303-8e887f310dcf, which exists as a tracked source receipt. Both source-workspace and snapshot-workspace linked profiles reproduce the missing-reference verdict. Trace how isolated tracker roots retain authoritative receipt and Git-index identity without consulting unrelated workspaces or weakening evidence verification."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T21:01:02.654Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-26T12:03:25.074Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-26T12:03:24.422Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-26T12:03:24.422Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: Reproduce with an isolated real-Git fixture containing a durable receipt referenced by item history; Preserve supported source and snapshot workspace identity at receipt verification; Keep missing and corrupted receipt controls fail-closed; Prove source and isolated tracker bytes remain unchanged
parent: pm-9rgaal
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Preserve exact bounded stage-zero source-index receipt proof through read-only source bindings and independent snapshot indexes, including staged and custom roots. Snapshot transfers propagate source discovery/index/object errors and reject incomplete blobs before changing receipt authority; ordinary proof queries remain fail closed and outer no-Git snapshots remain supported."
expected_result: Source and snapshot contexts authenticate only valid exact indexed receipt proof without changing source state; a failed source read preserves the snapshot receipt namespace.
actual_result: "Native staged/custom/untracked/conflict/divergence controls pass. Five source-fault conditions preserve snapshot index bytes and authority; focused30 tests cover both affected modules at100 percent in every metric, linked44 tests pass, and types/build/lint/SDK/graph/record/mutation gates pass. Quiet latency and corrected packed continuation acceptance pass. Exact new-head global coverage and review are mandatory before merge."
